# This dependency-free example needs no configuration and no API keys — the demo
# and tests run on the standard library alone. This file is a placeholder for the
# production version, which would drive the orchestrator and sub-agents with a
# real model:
#
# MODEL_API_KEY=<your-model-provider-api-key>
# MODEL_ENDPOINT=<your-endpoint>
#
# Copy to .env and fill in real values only if you wire in a live model.
# Never commit the .env file itself.
